OL,3,GNEWSAF1 driver George Russell opens
OL,4,Ayouth karting academy
OL,5,
OL,6,FF1 ace George Russell has launched a
OL,7,Fkarting programme to help young drivers
OL,8,Fdevelop their motorsport skills.
OL,10,FThe GR63 Karting Academy, based next to
OL,11,FSilverstone Circuit in
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, will offer children
OL,13,Faged eight to nine the chance to
OL,14,Fcompete for places in an eight-round
OL,15,Fchampionship next year.
OL,17,FThe academy will operate through four
OL,18,Fstages, beginning with qualifying
OL,19,Fsessions from 6 to 31 December.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
